    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Sweet Toy Simulator: Build Your Colorful Toy &amp; Candy Shop!</strong> \ud83c\udf1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to open your dream toy and candy store?<br>In Sweet Toy Simulator, stock your shelves, delight your customers, grow your business, and become the owner of the sweetest shop! \ud83e\uddf8\ud83c\udf6d\ud83c\udf89</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89 Join our community on Discord! \ud83c\udf89</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Be the first to get updates, share your ideas, ask questions, and connect with fellow Sweet Toy Simulator fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s grow our store together! \ud83e\uddf8\ud83c\udf6c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/9b77d074574ecf7a11741945de16e419.webp?t=1750174215\" width=398 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Toy Simulator is a fun simulation game where players get to build, manage, and grow their very own toy and candy store.<br>Manage colorful toys and delicious sweets on your shelves and make your customers smile! \ud83d\ude0a\ud83c\udf81</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/0934ad5339592d994dccd26c93f81d0f.poster.avif?t=1750174215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/0934ad5339592d994dccd26c93f81d0f.webm?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/0934ad5339592d994dccd26c93f81d0f.mp4?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/cd1da4b86321ca44ab9e05c6e289167c.webp?t=1750174215\" width=398 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new toy and candy licenses to add variety and excitement to your store! \ud83d\ude80\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/1f2660afbfc4c895f67aed494ced04e0.poster.avif?t=1750174215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/1f2660afbfc4c895f67aed494ced04e0.webm?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/1f2660afbfc4c895f67aed494ced04e0.mp4?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/6e9409c94352d5c06b8bf17c2e56a680.webp?t=1750174215\" width=398 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place toy boxes in your warehouse, organize your store with colorful round shelves and special display stands. \ud83c\udfa0\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/0b4cc6e4e6c048a849c3e0c685135601.poster.avif?t=1750174215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/0b4cc6e4e6c048a849c3e0c685135601.webm?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/0b4cc6e4e6c048a849c3e0c685135601.mp4?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/d97e6ddf8dce03b298e85c821478073a.webp?t=1750174215\" width=398 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire cashiers, shelf arrangers, and warehouse workers to speed up your business. More time, more sales! \ud83d\udcbc\u23f0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/aaa4aed43287c482334745df79fc409f.poster.avif?t=1750174215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/aaa4aed43287c482334745df79fc409f.webm?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/aaa4aed43287c482334745df79fc409f.mp4?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/c20a8bfeb2ccc5600d96b39614eedcbd.webp?t=1750174215\" width=398 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to expand your store, open new areas, and sell more toys and sweets! \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/37c56cc6a534df0b215f2ecf0c870934.poster.avif?t=1750174215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/37c56cc6a534df0b215f2ecf0c870934.webm?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/37c56cc6a534df0b215f2ecf0c870934.mp4?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/2ef49fd80756bdd4167148f7dde96c49.webp?t=1750174215\" width=398 height=44 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfectly organize your store with colorful round shelves, toy stands, and cute boxes! \ud83e\uddf8\ud83c\udf80\ud83c\udf81</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/de1049a7704466bc81d1831e772c3a47.poster.avif?t=1750174215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/de1049a7704466bc81d1831e772c3a47.webm?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/de1049a7704466bc81d1831e772c3a47.mp4?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/62bcfd8358a13e69b953cbaf0ff08dd5.webp?t=1750174215\" width=398 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your prices, increase profits, and develop smart trading strategies. \ud83d\udcca\ud83d\udca1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/7be902d44f35ec178840c591831f0f8a.poster.avif?t=1750174215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/7be902d44f35ec178840c591831f0f8a.webm?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/7be902d44f35ec178840c591831f0f8a.mp4?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Sweet Toy Simulator: Build Your Colorful Toy &amp; Candy Shop!</strong> \ud83c\udf1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to open your dream toy and candy store?<br>In Sweet Toy Simulator, stock your shelves, delight your customers, grow your business, and become the owner of the sweetest shop! \ud83e\uddf8\ud83c\udf6d\ud83c\udf89</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89 Join our community on Discord! \ud83c\udf89</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Be the first to get updates, share your ideas, ask questions, and connect with fellow Sweet Toy Simulator fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s grow our store together! \ud83e\uddf8\ud83c\udf6c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/9b77d074574ecf7a11741945de16e419.webp?t=1750174215\" width=398 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Toy Simulator is a fun simulation game where players get to build, manage, and grow their very own toy and candy store.<br>Manage colorful toys and delicious sweets on your shelves and make your customers smile! \ud83d\ude0a\ud83c\udf81</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/0934ad5339592d994dccd26c93f81d0f.poster.avif?t=1750174215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/0934ad5339592d994dccd26c93f81d0f.webm?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770980/extras/0934ad5339592d994dccd26c93f81d0f.mp4?t=1750174215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid